			"Message": "docs(Wind): Update and restructure CHANGELOG.md format\n\nRestructure the Wind CHANGELOG.md with improved formatting: add a descriptive project intro explaining Wind's role as the Effect-TS-driven UI service layer; convert version sections to include date annotations in headers; reformat bullet points with bold emphasis for scannability; consolidate v1.3-v0.0 entries into more compact descriptions; maintain all historical content while improving visual hierarchy and consistency with Keep a Changelog conventions.\n\nThe changelog now reads more as narrative history in our voice rather than a raw activity log.",
			"SHA": "5b84796fcdbeb1fd0a8f5b126eb44877ac774688"
		},
